 401+ 5F84 7A               ld   a, d
 402+ 5F85 B6               or   (hl)
 403+ 5F86 77               ld   (hl), a
 404+ 5F87 23               inc  hl
 405+ 5F88 7B               ld   a, e
 406+ 5F89 B6               or   (hl)
